        "id": 53,
        "title": "How do you create an Express application?",
        "category": "2. Intermediate Level (51–100) - Express.js & REST APIs",
        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "You import the `express` module, invoke it to create an `app` object, define your routes on that object, and then call the `listen` method to bind it to a network port.",
