        "id": 71,
        "title": "What is body-parser?",
        "category": "2. Intermediate Level (51–100) - Express.js & REST APIs",
        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "`body-parser` is a middleware package that extracts the entire body portion of an incoming HTTP request and exposes it on `req.body`. Without it, `req.body` is `undefined` because Node.js handles incoming data as raw, chunked binary streams, not as neatly formatted JSON.",
