        "category": "4. Bonus Questions (151–225) - Real-Time, DevOps & Testing",
        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "A `Dockerfile` is a plain text file containing a set of step-by-step instructions used by Docker to build a container image. It defines the base OS, copies the source code into the container, installs dependencies, and specifies the command to start the application.",
