        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "1. **SSL Termination:** NGINX handles the heavy CPU math required to decrypt HTTPS traffic, saving Node.js CPU cycles for business logic.\n2. **Static Files:** NGINX serves HTML/CSS/Images 10x faster than Express (`express.static()`).\n3. **Load Balancing:** It can distribute traffic across 5 different Node.js servers (Round Robin).\n4. **Security:** It hides the internal Node.js port (3000) from the outside world and can rate-limit or block malicious IPs before they reach the app.",
