        "explanation": "GraphQL is a query language for APIs developed by Facebook. Unlike REST, where the server determines what data is sent back, GraphQL allows the client (the frontend) to ask for exactly the data it needs, and nothing more. It operates over a single endpoint (usually `POST /graphql`).",
