        "category": "4. Bonus Questions (151–225) - Real-Time, DevOps & Testing",
        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "IoC is a broad architectural principle where the control flow of a program is inverted. Instead of your custom code calling a library to execute a task, a generic framework calls *your* custom code. Dependency Injection is just one specific implementation of the broader IoC principle.",
